    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-11-08T21:20:28+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-08T21:20:28+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-08T10:50:28Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-08T10:50:28Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A high pressure system centred west of TAS will continue to drift eastwards, while a weak low pressure system and trough near the western border continue to move eastwards. The high will drift southeast of Tasmania by Monday, while the trough and low continue to move eastwards across SA, clearing to the east later Tuesday. Another high will develop south of the state on Wednesday. Another trough extends into the far west of SA later Thursday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW014" description="North East Pastoral" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-11-08T21:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-09T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-08T10:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-08T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly clear. The chance of a thunderstorm west of Leigh Creek. Winds easterly 25 to 40 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-11-09T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-10T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-08T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-09T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers. The chance of a thunderstorm. The chance of raised dust west of Leigh Creek in the late morning and afternoon. Winds east to northeasterly 30 to 45 km/h tending north to northeasterly in the middle of the day then tending east to northeasterly 25 to 35 km/h in the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 11 and 24 with daytime temperatures reaching 28 to 41.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">High</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:00am to 5:00pm, UV Index predicted to reach 11 [Extreme]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-11-10T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-11T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-09T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-10T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. The chance of a thunderstorm with little or no rainfall. Winds east to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h tending northwest to northeasterly before dawn then tending south to southwesterly 25 to 35 km/h in the early morning. Overnight temperatures falling to between 14 and 25 with daytime temperatures reaching 33 to 40.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-11-11T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-12T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-10T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-11T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. The chance of a thunderstorm with little or no rainfall north of Oodnadatta in the morning and afternoon. Winds southerly 25 to 35 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to between 13 and 24 with daytime temperatures reaching 30 to 36.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-11-12T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-13T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-11T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-12T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny morning. The chance of a thunderstorm north of Leigh Creek in the afternoon and evening. Winds south to southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to between 12 and 23 with daytime temperatures reaching 31 to 37.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
